// PURPOSE
// Build the first Agent 365 hunting baseline from AgentsInfo.
// Use this before looking for governance gaps or tool/MCP exposure.
//
// BEFORE RUNNING
// 1. Verify that AgentsInfo exists in your tenant.
// 2. Inspect the current schema in Advanced Hunting.
// 3. Confirm that the projected fields are populated for your platforms.
//
// EXPECTED OUTPUT
// A recent list of agents with identifiers, type, platform and status.
// Save the query timestamp and result count as assessment evidence.
//
// NEXT
// Continue with 02-governance-gaps.kql.
// Full guide: examples/kql/README.md

AgentsInfo
| project Timestamp, AgentName, AgentId, AgentType, Platform, Status
| order by Timestamp desc
